          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "When the caster of this spell is a target of a spell from the realm of Essence, the \"incoming\" spell must first make an RR before the caster makes an RR. For RR purposes, each spell uses a level equal to the level of its caster. If the \"incoming\" spell passes the RR, it may target the caster normally; otherwise, the incoming spell has no effect on this target."
